      "weather": "Fine",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW KITTY (1) missed the frame and safely held latest finishing 6th at Wagga following on from a win (18.73) at this track the start prior. Has a good record here at this journey. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. CLASSIC EDGE (2) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 19.00 beating Run Bindi Run. Won at her only start from this box. Capable of going well again. CASH DE ORO (8) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last four runs. Last time finished 3rd over 330m at this track beaten 1.5 lengths (19.10) behind CLASSIC EDGE in a Grade 5 on October 25. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Expected to feature again. PAW HART (4) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
